00:04:11.269 --> 00:04:14.400
Starting things off, when they first got stared
with Iron Man.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:20.350
Almost every writer in Hollywood they offered
it to turned it down.

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:24.870
The only reason they were able to obtain financing
for the first couple of films was by bundling

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:29.380
them together in what would eventually be
known as the Marvel Cinematic Universe.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.760
So it wasn’t just a creative decision.

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:37.550
They did it because financially, that’s
the only way the bank would buy into it.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:41.650
During the first Iron Man, after Gwyneth Paltrow
signed on to the project and came in to meet

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:50.960
with Favreau and RDJ for the first time, they
all ended up crying because they were so happy.

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:56.570
Samuel L Jackson won the role of Nick Fury
in that same Iron Man film because his agent

00:04:56.570 --> 00:05:01.310
cold called Kevin Fiege and they loved the
idea.

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:04.990
The Tesseract became the first big macguffin.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:09.729
The thing that drove the plot forward with
very little if no explanation.

00:05:09.729 --> 00:05:14.360
In phase 2 it’s the infinity gems and in
phase 3 it will be the infinity gauntlet.

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:18.630
